<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK Q1 97 TRADE DEFICIT WIDENS TO SKK 15.89 BLN.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK Q1 97 TRADE DEFICIT WIDENS TO SKK 15.89 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's first quarter trade deficit widened, year-on-year, to 15.894 billion crowns, from a 15.440 billion crown shortfall for the same period in 1996, the statistical bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
